<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange ended higher in moderate trading Friday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 32.91 points to 7169.53. For the week, the Dow rose 98.33 points.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 2.33 to 429.23.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.23.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1525 to 933.</p>
<p>Volume was 455,619,620 compared with 534,105,220 on Thursday. For the week, volume totalled 2,663,799,620 shares.</p>
